# Force LF everywhere, in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# This is not a style preference. Project templates are rendered verbatim into
# generated projects, so a template checked out with CRLF produces CRLF Go
# source, and every generated file then fails gofmt. On Windows, core.autocrlf
# is commonly on and would do exactly that to a fresh clone.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binaries git must never touch.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
